    "Building foundation floor plan created with 3D Home Architect Deluxe, a home design program; stores the layout of the houses structural foundation; the actual ground floor layout is stored in a.PL1 file. NOTE: Broderbund no longer develops 3D Home Architect Deluxe. Windows Broderbund 3D Home Architect Deluxe.",
