    ".GMT",
    "rFactor Model File",
    "3.5",
    "Three-dimensional model used by rFactor, a car racing simulation game; saves the 3D model for a vehicle, vehicle upgrade component, or a track; used for loading graphics in the rFactor 3D game engine. Windows Image Space rFactor. Zanoza ZModeler with GMT filter.",
