    ".FXS",
    "messiahStudio Scene File",
    "3.5",
    "3D scene created by messiahStudio animation and rendering software; stores both model and animation data; used for storing characters and their motions; can include meshes, textures, motions, lighting effects, and other model information. Objects from messiahStudio scenes can be exported to a variety of formats, including.OBJ,.3DS, and.DXF formats. Windows pmG messiahStudio Mac pmG messiahStudio.",
