    ".GRN",
    "Granny 3D File",
    "3.5",
    "Three-dimensional model or animation created with Granny 3D, a toolkit for building 3D games; supports 3D meshes, texture mapping, and animations; used in many 3D games and can be viewed with Granny Viewer. Windows RAD Game Tools Granny 3D. RAD Game Tools Granny Viewer Mac RAD Game Tools Granny 3D. Linux RAD Game Tools Granny 3D.",
