    "3D image created using Minoltas Vivid 3D Scanner; generated from multiple scans that are combined into a single 3D mesh; can be opened and edited with Minoltas Polygon Editing Tool (PET) as well as various other third-party programs. Windows Konica Minolta Polygon Editing Tool (PET) Okino Computer Graphics PolyTrans with Minolta Geometry Import Converter. Polyworks Modeler with IMAlign Plugin.",
