    "Bryce Leaf Shape File",
    "2.5",
    "3D model file used by Bryce, a 3D modeling program; contains a preset shape for a leaf that can be added to 3D scenes; can be used for enhancing trees, which are stored using the.BTO extension. Several LPS files are included with Bryce installations. They are located in the /​Presets/​Leaves/​ directory. Windows DAZ 3D Bryce 7 Pro. Mac DAZ 3D Bryce 7 Pro.",
