    "3D shader settings file created by DAZ Studio 3D modeling software; stores settings for a light shader; can be opened and edited with the Shader Mixer, which can be viewed by selecting Tools → Tabs → Shader Mixer; used for saving light shader presets. Mac DAZ 3D DAZ Studio 4. Windows DAZ 3D DAZ Studio 4Free.",
